  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Older People in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a result of the Russian invasion, the lives of millions of older Ukrainians are at risk. They&apos;re in danger of being displaced by the conflict, denied access to essential services or forced to flee to neighboring countries. Those unable to move are often abandoned in war-torn areas. One-fourth of Ukrainians are 60+ and more than half said the war had harmed their mental health. We&apos;re working with our partners on the ground to provide food, medicine, hygiene supplies, home-based care and more.</narrative>
  </description>
